@host = http://localhost:8080

### Create product
POST {{host}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Smart TV 55",
  "description": "OLED 4K"
}

### Add price with closed validity
POST {{host}}/products/1/prices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 499.90,
  "initDate": "2026-01-01",
  "endDate": "2026-06-30"
}

### Add open-ended price starting the day after
POST {{host}}/products/1/prices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 459.00,
  "initDate": "2026-07-01"
}

### Get price in force at a date
GET {{host}}/products/1/prices?date=2026-03-15

### Get full price history
GET {{host}}/products/1/prices

### 400 invalid date range (initDate equals endDate)
POST {{host}}/products/1/prices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 10.00,
  "initDate": "2027-05-10",
  "endDate": "2027-05-10"
}

### 400 malformed date query param
GET {{host}}/products/1/prices?date=15-03-2026

### 404 PRODUCT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{host}}/products/424242/prices?date=2026-03-15

### 404 PRICE_NOT_FOUND
GET {{host}}/products/1/prices?date=2019-01-01

### 409 PRICE_OVERLAP (shares the inclusive end day 2026-06-30)
POST {{host}}/products/1/prices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 479.00,
  "initDate": "2026-06-30",
  "endDate": "2026-12-31"
}
